title: "LQU-driven Heisenberg dimer"
abstract: >-
  Code to reproduce the figures of the paper "General perturbation
  theory for local quantum uncertainty and its formulation in the
  linear-response regime," applied to the isotropic Heisenberg dimer
  under a periodic driving field.
